# Foundry Commands & Development Workflows

## Essential Foundry Commands

### Build & Compile
```bash
# Standard build
forge build

# Build with specific contracts
forge build --contracts src/Feed.sol

# Build with size information
forge build --sizes

# Clean build artifacts
forge clean
```

### Testing Commands
```bash
# Run all tests
forge test

# Run tests with verbose output
forge test -vvv

# Run specific test file
forge test --match-path test/Feed.t.sol

# Run specific test function
forge test --match-test testPublishAnswer

# Run tests with gas reporting
forge test --gas-report

# Generate coverage report
forge coverage

# Run fuzz tests with more runs
forge test --fuzz-runs 10000
```

### Code Quality
```bash
# Format code
forge fmt

# Generate documentation
forge doc

# Check code formatting
forge fmt --check
```

### Dependency Management
Based on [foundry.toml](mdc:foundry.toml) configuration:

```bash
# Install dependencies
forge install

# Install specific dependency
forge install OpenZeppelin/openzeppelin-contracts

# Update dependencies
forge update

# Remove dependency
forge remove openzeppelin-contracts

# List dependencies
forge tree
```

### Local Development
```bash
# Start local blockchain
anvil

# Start with specific accounts
anvil --accounts 10 --balance 1000

# Start with mnemonic
anvil --mnemonic "test test test test test test test test test test test junk"
```

### Deployment Commands

#### Local Deployment
```bash
# Deploy to local network (anvil)
forge script script/Deploy.s.sol \
    --rpc-url http://localhost:8545 \
    --private-key 0xac0974bec39a17e36ba4a6b4d238ff944bacb478cbed5efcae784d7bf4f2ff80 \
    --broadcast
```

#### Testnet Deployment
```bash
# Deploy to Sepolia testnet
forge script script/Deploy.s.sol \
    --rpc-url $SEPOLIA_RPC_URL \
    --private-key $PRIVATE_KEY \
    --broadcast \
    --verify \
    --etherscan-api-key $ETHERSCAN_API_KEY
```

### Contract Interaction (Cast)
```bash
# Call view function
cast call <CONTRACT_ADDRESS> "getLatest()" --rpc-url $RPC_URL

# Send transaction
cast send <CONTRACT_ADDRESS> "setSubscriptionPrice(address,uint128)" <FEED_ADDRESS> 1000000 \
    --rpc-url $RPC_URL \
    --private-key $PRIVATE_KEY

# Check balance
cast balance <ADDRESS> --rpc-url $RPC_URL

# Get transaction receipt
cast receipt <TX_HASH> --rpc-url $RPC_URL
```

## Project-Specific Workflows

### Setting up New Contract

1. **Create Interface**
   ```bash
   # Create interface file in src/interfaces/
   touch src/interfaces/INewContract.sol
   ```

2. **Implement Contract**
   ```bash
   # Create implementation file
   touch src/NewContract.sol
   ```

3. **Create Tests**
   ```bash
   # Create test file
   touch test/NewContract.t.sol
   ```

4. **Build and Test**
   ```bash
   forge build
   forge test --match-path test/NewContract.t.sol -vvv
   ```

### Testing Workflow for Existing Contracts

#### Feed Contract Testing ([Feed.sol](mdc:src/Feed.sol))
```bash
# Test feed operations
forge test --match-path test/Feed.t.sol -vvv

# Test with gas reporting
forge test --match-path test/Feed.t.sol --gas-report

# Fuzz test feed functions
forge test --match-test testFuzzPublishAnswer --fuzz-runs 1000
```

#### Registry Testing ([FeedsRegistry.sol](mdc:src/FeedsRegistry.sol))
```bash
# Test registry functions
forge test --match-path test/FeedsRegistry.t.sol -vvv

# Test access control
forge test --match-test testOnlyFeedsManager -vvv
```

### Security Analysis Workflow
```bash
# Install security tools (if not already installed)
pip install slither-analyzer mythril

# Run Slither analysis
slither .

# Run Mythril analysis
myth analyze src/Feed.sol

# Run comprehensive test suite
forge test -vvv

# Generate gas snapshot
forge snapshot
```

### Pre-Deployment Checklist
```bash
# 1. Build contracts
forge build

# 2. Run all tests
forge test

# 3. Check test coverage
forge coverage

# 4. Security analysis
slither .

# 5. Gas optimization check
forge test --gas-report

# 6. Format code
forge fmt

# 7. Generate documentation
forge doc
```

## Environment Configuration

### Environment Variables
Create `.env` file with:
```bash
# RPC URLs
MAINNET_RPC_URL=https://eth-mainnet.g.alchemy.com/v2/your-api-key
SEPOLIA_RPC_URL=https://eth-sepolia.g.alchemy.com/v2/your-api-key
ANVIL_RPC_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8545

# Private Keys (TESTING ONLY)
PRIVATE_KEY=0x...

# API Keys
ETHERSCAN_API_KEY=your-etherscan-api-key
```

### Load Environment
```bash
# Source environment variables
source .env

# Or use with commands
forge script script/Deploy.s.sol --rpc-url $SEPOLIA_RPC_URL --private-key $PRIVATE_KEY
```

## Debugging Commands

### Debug Failed Transactions
```bash
# Get detailed error information
cast run <TX_HASH> --rpc-url $RPC_URL --debug

# Trace transaction
cast run <TX_HASH> --rpc-url $RPC_URL --trace
```

### Debug Test Failures
```bash
# Run with maximum verbosity
forge test --match-test testFailingFunction -vvvv

# Debug with traces
forge test --match-test testFailingFunction --debug
```

## Performance Optimization

### Gas Optimization
```bash
# Generate gas snapshot
forge snapshot

# Compare gas usage
forge snapshot --diff

# Gas reporting for specific test
forge test --match-test testExpensiveFunction --gas-report
```

### Build Optimization
```bash
# Enable optimizations in foundry.toml
# [profile.default]
# optimizer = true
# optimizer_runs = 200

# Build with optimizations
forge build --optimize
```
